            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<h3><strong><strong>...short stories...small rebellions...mini manifestos...personal fables...snippets of memory...</strong></strong></h3><p><br>You’re invited to open the ‘Curiosity Cabinet’, a night of unique &amp; unusual experimental film from around the world, both delightful and macabre. With techniques ranging from stop motion wooden animation, claymation, digital dancing, 16mm analogue film, camcorder video and more, ‘Curiosity Cabinet’ has something new for everyone. We’re excited to share with you this collection of short films coming from 16 countries across 5 continents - expect CGI bones, paper cutout bugs, extravagant makeup, and abstract atmospheres!</p>",
