              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p><br></p><h3>Artist/Filmmaker List:</h3><p><strong><strong>Bofei Wan • Federico Castillo Trejo • Jeremy Moss • Kawon Lee • Laura Mazo-Arboleda • Lorenzo Fiale • Lysander Wong • Mariana Fantich &amp; Dominic Young • Paolo Ricaldone • Paul Nox Bianchi • Robert Lamond Gibson • Romàn Goldet • Sarah Kern • Shuchen Zhai • Sucheta Naresh Gulrajani • Sylvia Robyn Gionti • Victoria Gong • Zed Xu </strong></strong><strong><strong>榛子瞬</strong></strong><strong><strong> • Zeineb Saiem</strong></strong></p>",
