              "type": "text",
              "text": "<h3>About the Venue:</h3><h4><strong><strong>Eastway Baths, </strong></strong><strong><strong>Hackney Wick</strong></strong></h4><p>Eastway Baths is a cultural and community hub based in a historic Victorian bathhouse in Hackney Wick, London. The venue brings together a café, event spaces, studios and community facilities to support a diverse ecosystem of artists, practitioners, local residents and small businesses.</p><p>Each week the space hosts a wide range of activities including cultural events, workshops, performances, wellbeing sessions, community gatherings and creative programmes. With thousands of visitors passing through the building regularly, Eastway Baths has become an active meeting point for the local neighbourhood and a platform for independent cultural production.</p>",
