              "type": "text",
              "text": "<h3>Getting Here:</h3><h4><strong><strong>80 EASTWAY, LONDON E9 5JH</strong></strong></h4><p>The nearest train stations are Hackney Wick overground station (0.5 miles), approximately 12 min walk. Routes from Hackney Wick station to the venue consist of level access enabled by dropped kerbs; however tactile paving/detectable warning surfaces are limited.</p><p>The nearest bus stops are:</p><p>Trowbridge Estate, Stop P, 40 yards. (Buses: 236, 276, 388) • Osbourne Road, Stop S, 120 yards. (Buses: 276) • Trowbridge Estate, Stop Q, 130 yards. (Buses: 236, 276, 388) • St Mary of Eton Church, Stop L, 0.1 mile. (Buses: 388) • Berkshire Road, Stop V, 0.3 miles. (Buses: 276)</p><h3>Accessibility Information:</h3><p>The café/bar space is wheelchair accessible via a platform lift. Please use the doorbell on the grey doors to the right of our main entrance to call a member of staff, who will bring the lift down and open the wheelchair accessible door.</p><p>The height of the bar is 103 cm. The menu boards are visible from this point. We have a gender-neutral, wheelchair-accessible toilet.</p><p>Once in the space, the Lounge and the Civic Classroom offer direct barrier-free access, while the Events Hall and the Garden are accessible via another platform lift.</p><p>Eastway Baths has all accessibility information available in a document <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xNabzXtIk2LHzvojnErqg6bw6yR46hy5/view?usp=sharing\" title=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xNabzXtIk2LHzvojnErqg6bw6yR46hy5/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-msys-clicktrack=\"0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">here</a>.</p>",
